{{:Header/Crusades}}
Use Tinkering to craft and equip with materials gained from [[Crusades]]. There are 6 free equipment slots and 1 premium slot that can be purchased with 350 gems. No Tinkering materials, levels, or equipment are lost after [[Ascension|Ascending]].
== Materials ==
