==Tinkering Boosts==
*The third right perk in the Crusades perk tree grants +10% tinkering EXP per level, up to +100%.
*The Desert Giant and Fabricio Crusade cards grant +12% and +8% tinkering EXP respectively, upgradeable to +240% and +160%.
